				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-919714#post-3696347</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-919714/sc-13-234-14-362#post-3696347</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 31 Jan 2018 02:35:37 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>7happy7</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3427263</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I report on the completion of <a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/sc-13-234-14-362">the Japanese translation</a> of this article and the self-solution on the meaning of &quot;Red sight&quot;. By translating this article and reading other articles, I was convinced that &quot;Red sight&quot; is like a drug.</p> <p>Thank you for helping me solve my doubts seriously, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boogey-man23" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2362395&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1517366496" alt="Boogey_Man23" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2362395)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boogey-man23" >Boogey_Man23</a></span>.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-919714#post-3682447</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-919714/sc-13-234-14-362#post-3682447</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 15 Jan 2018 09:44:47 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>7happy7</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3427263</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>I'm able to find appears in&nbsp;this other CI GOI-format.&nbsp;</p> </blockquote> <p>I have read the article from your advice.<br /> Perhaps &quot;the Red Sight&quot; isn′t the name of a real equipment but is the name of CI's own equipment?</p> <blockquote> <p>contacting the original author</p> </blockquote> <p>Yeah, I'll try to send PM to them.</p> <blockquote> <p>Should that fail, starting up a thread on it in the&nbsp;Foundation Universe Forum&nbsp;may draw some answers.</p> </blockquote> <p>I understand. If the authors can′t reply to me, I think I will start up a forum.</p> <p>Thanks for your advice.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-919714#post-3682416</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-919714/sc-13-234-14-362#post-3682416</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 15 Jan 2018 08:28:56 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Boogey_Man23</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2362395</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Hmm&#8230; Searching the wiki, the only other mention of &quot;Red Sight&quot; I'm able to find appears in <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/sc-10-548-12-893">this other CI GOI-format</a>. But I can't deduce from context there either exactly what it refers to. My initial thought is that it might be the CI's name for some corresponding SCP, but I'm not sure.</p> <p>I think the way to get a definitive answer might be contacting the original author here (<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/missmercurial" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1786386&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516004935" alt="MissMercurial" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1786386)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/missmercurial" >MissMercurial</a></span>) or of the other article referencing it (<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chubert" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=502908&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516004935" alt="Chubert" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=502908)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chubert" >Chubert</a></span>), if they're still active in the community.</p> <p>Should that fail, starting up a thread on it in the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/c-88827/foundation-universe">Foundation Universe Forum</a> may draw some answers.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
